{"content":"# 3D with Three.js Reference

Reference: https://www.remotion.dev/docs/three

## Install
```bash
npx remotion add @remotion/three
```

## Core Concept: <ThreeCanvas>
```tsx
import { ThreeCanvas } from "@remotion/three";

<ThreeCanvas
  width={1920}
  height={1080}
  camera={{ position: [0, 0, 5], fov: 50 }}
  shadows
>
  <Scene />
</ThreeCanvas>
```

## Animation: useCurrentFrame() NOT useFrame()
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN
import { useFrame } from "@react-three/fiber";
useFrame(({ clock }) => { mesh.rotation.y = clock.getElapsedTime(); });

// ✅ REQUIRED
import { useCurrentFrame } from "remotion";
const frame = useCurrentFrame();
const { fps } = useVideoConfig();
mesh.rotation.y = frame / fps * Math.PI * 2;
```

## Scene Example
```tsx
import { useCurrentFrame, useVideoConfig } from "remotion";
import { Mesh, BoxGeometry, MeshStandardMaterial } from "three";

const RotatingCube = () => {
  const frame = useCurrentFrame();
  const { fps } = useVideoConfig();

  return (
    <Mesh>
      <BoxGeometry args={[2, 2, 2]} />
      <MeshStandardMaterial color="#0066ff" />
    </Mesh>
  );
};

// In ThreeCanvas:
<ThreeCanvas>
  <ambientLight intensity={0.5} />
  <directionalLight position={[5, 10, 7]} intensity={1} />
  <RotatingCube />
</ThreeCanvas>
```

## Lights & Shadows
```tsx
<directionalLight position={[5, 10, 7]} intensity={1} castShadow />
<spotLight position={[0, 10, 0]} angle={Math.PI / 4} penumbra={0.5} castShadow />
<pointLight position={[-5, 5, 5]} intensity={1} />
```

## Camera Animation
```tsx
const frame = useCurrentFrame();
const { fps } = useVideoConfig();

<ThreeCanvas
  camera={{
    position: [
      Math.sin(frame / fps * Math.PI * 2) * 10,
      5,
      Math.cos(frame / fps * Math.PI * 2) * 10
    ],
    fov: 50,
  }}
>
```

## Models (GLTF)
```tsx
import { useGLTF } from "@react-three/drei";

const Model = () => {
  const { scene } = useGLTF("/model.glb");
  return <primitive object={scene} />;
};
```

## Post-Processing
```tsx
import { EffectComposer, BloomEffect } from "@react-three/postprocessing";

<ThreeCanvas>
  <EffectComposer>
    <BloomEffect intensity={1} threshold={0.8} />
  </EffectComposer>
</ThreeCanvas>
```

## Key Rules
| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|-------|
| `useFrame()` from R3F | `useCurrentFrame()` from Remotion |
| `<Canvas>` | `<ThreeCanvas>` |
| CSS animations | Frame-based math via `useCurrentFrame()` |
| `clock.getElapsedTime()` | `frame / fps` |

## Performance
- Keep geometry simple
- Reuse materials
- Limit shadow-casting lights
- Use `InstancedMesh` for repeated objects","path":"/d/Portable_Soft/hermes/.claude/skills/remotion-video/references/3d.md"}

